<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>The e-mail of your account was changed</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
    The e-mail of your account <strong>{$userEntity->username}</strong> was changed to <strong>{$newEmail}</strong>.
</p>

<p>
    If it was not you, please change your password right away.
</p>
</body>
</html>
